    {"type":"text","id":"m2_thread_title","x":900,"y":1210,"width":630,"height":28,"text":"线程 / Future / Affinity：为什么 MQ socket 不在 worker thread 使用","originalText":"线程 / Future / Affinity：为什么 MQ socket 不在 worker thread 使用","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#1e40af","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":1300007,"version":1,"versionNonce":1300008,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"type":"text","id":"m2_thread_text","x":910,"y":1260,"width":610,"height":270,"text":"ClientPollingLoop（进程级单例 daemon thread）\n  · 注册全部 DEALER sockets\n  · drain outbound queues\n  · poll inbound → complete MessagingFuture\n\nmq-server-thread（唯一操作 ROUTER socket）\n  · SYNC handler 直接执行\n  · BLOCKING/NORMAL → ThreadPoolExecutor\n  · STORE/RETRIEVE → AffinityThreadPool\n    affinity_key = hash(ZMQ client identity)\n\nWorker callback 只把 response frame 放 output_queue\nEventNotifier(eventfd/pipe) 唤醒 MQ thread 发送\n\nHandlerType.NON_BLOCKING：枚举保留，但当前 NotImplemented","originalText":"ClientPollingLoop（进程级单例 daemon thread）\n  · 注册全部 DEALER sockets\n  · drain outbound queues\n  · poll inbound → complete MessagingFuture\n\nmq-server-thread（唯一操作 ROUTER socket）\n  · SYNC handler 直接执行\n  · BLOCKING/NORMAL → ThreadPoolExecutor\n  · STORE/RETRIEVE → AffinityThreadPool\n    affinity_key = hash(ZMQ client identity)\n\nWorker callback 只把 response frame 放 output_queue\nEventNotifier(eventfd/pipe) 唤醒 MQ thread 发送\n\nHandlerType.NON_BLOCKING：枚举保留，但当前 NotImplemented","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":1300009,"version":1,"versionNonce":1300010,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},
