    {"type":"text","id":"m2_lmc_driven_text","x":1940,"y":1280,"width":235,"height":105,"text":"LMCache-driven\n注册：DeviceIPCWrapper\n每次：event handle + block ids\nServer 执行 D2H/H2D\nCUDA IPC / CPU wrapper\n低控制载荷 · 同节点 IPC","originalText":"LMCache-driven\n注册：DeviceIPCWrapper\n每次：event handle + block ids\nServer 执行 D2H/H2D\nCUDA IPC / CPU wrapper\n低控制载荷 · 同节点 IPC","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":1300021,"version":1,"versionNonce":1300022,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},
